  <p id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p001:m0000" ref="so9_dzz_czr">鄱陽王鏘</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p001:m0006" ref="so9_dzz_czr">宣韶</persName>，太祖第七子也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p002:m0000" ref="el1_amk_djh">始興簡王鑒</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p002:m0007" ref="el1_amk_djh">宣徹</persName>，太祖第十子也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p003:m0000" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_F">宜都王鏗</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanqishu-035-ziqing-princes:p003:m0006" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_F">宣嚴</persName>，太祖第十六子也。</p>
